      "kind": "broadcast",
      "text": "This is the survey vessel Meridian. We are holding position, and all systems are nominal. If you can hear this, please respond. This message repeats."
    },
    {
      "file": "signal/broadcast-listening.wav",
      "model": "real",
      "kind": "broadcast",
      "text": "If there is anybody out there, you are not alone. We are still listening on this frequency. We will keep listening."
    },
    {
      "file": "signal/broadcast-automated.wav",
      "model": "real",
      "kind": "broadcast",
      "text": "This is an automated message. The crew of the Meridian is well. We have light, and air, and time. If you receive this, answer on any channel."
    },
    {
      "file": "signal/broadcast-here.wav",
      "model": "real",
      "kind": "broadcast",
      "text": "To anyone receiving this signal. My name does not matter. I just wanted someone to know that we were here."
    },
    {
      "file": "signal/broadcast-lamps.wav",
      "model": "real",
      "kind": "broadcast",
      "text": "Day four thousand and twelve. Nothing to report. The lamps are on. We are leaving the lamps on for you."
    },
    {
      "file": "signal/broadcast-calling.wav",
